OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with heavy rain
OL,6,Fspreading eastwards and clearing
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. This leaves a
OL,8,Flargely dry afternoon with long sunny
OL,9,Fspells developing. Fresh to strong
OL,10,Fwinds will ease through the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening with lengthy
OL,13,Fclear spells for most places.
OL,14,FRemaining dry through the rest of the
OL,15,Fnight with lighter winds, but still
OL,16,Frather breezy on coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
