OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA dry day with lengthy sunny
OL,6,Fspells, especially across northern and
OL,7,Feastern Aberdeenshire. More in the way
OL,8,Fof cloud for Upper Deeside but still
OL,9,Fremaining dry.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,12,Fchangeable with showers or longer
OL,13,Fspells of rain on Friday, but
OL,14,Fgenerally drier on the weekend with
OL,15,Fbright spells.
